          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nguku rero uko ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", Imana ya Isirayeli, avuze: ‘Nari narasezeranye ko inzu ya so ari yo izokorera imbere yanje ibihe vyose.’ Ubu rero ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " avuze ati: ‘Ntibikabe!’ Abanyubaha ni bo nzokwubaha, ariko abankengera nanje nzobakengera.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ehe igihe kiraje aho nzokwaka inkomezi wewe n’inzu ya so nkabaka ubuherezi, kugira ngo ntihabe hakibaho umuntu aramba mu ruvyaro rwawe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi uzoba mu mubabaro uri mu nzu yanje. Naho Abisirayeli bazogirirwa neza, mu ruvyaro rwawe ntihazokwigera hongera kuboneka umuntu aramba agashika mu zabukuru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uwo nzosigaza adakuwe ku gicaniro canje azoba ari uwo kuguteza umubabaro no kukwihebuza, kandi abo mu ruvyaro rwawe bose bazopfa bakiri bato. Ariko abandi bose bazopfa bakiri mu myaka y’ubuto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“ ‘Ibizoba kuri Hofuni na Finehasi, abahungu bawe babiri, bizoba ikimenyetso c’ivyo, bazopfira umusi umwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzokwitorera uwuzombera umuherezi w’umwizigirwa, azokora ibiri ku mutima wanje no mu vyiyumviro vyanje. Kandi nzokomeza inzu y’ubuherezi bwiwe, baze bame bakorera imbere y’abami nasize amavuta ibihe vyose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 2:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ico gihe umuntu wese wo mu muryango wawe azosigara azoza amwunamire kugira ngo amuhe igiceri kimwe c’ifeza n’akavunguka k’umukate kandi amwinginge ati: “Ntabara umpe ico nkora mu bikorwa vy’ubuherezi kugira ngo ndonke ico kurya.” ’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.2.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.2.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
